From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dolphin XD <dolphinxd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:27:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Replace the on-screen controller with gesture controls

- The emulation screen hosts GestureInputView instead of InputOverlay.
- Two-finger tap, tap and hold opens the in-game Dolphin menu.
- The in-game menu gains "Gesture controls" and "Change game file" and
  loses the overlay controls and Change Disc entries.
- Show a menu gesture hint instead of the Back button hint.
